## Import

Starting in Terraform v1.5.0, you can use an [import block](https://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/language/import) to import `{{.Name}}`. For example:

```terraform
import {
  to = {{ .Name }}.example
  id = "see CLI command below for ID"
}
```

